name kfupm-math-exam
category Package
revision 63977
shortdesc A LaTeX document style to produce homework, quiz and exam papers
longdesc The package provides commands and environments that simplify
longdesc and streamline the process of preparing homework, quiz and exam
longdesc papers according to apreffered style. The default style is
longdesc based on the guidelines set by the department of mathematics at
longdesc King Fahd University of Petroleum and Minerals (KFUPM). It can
longdesc be easily customized to fit any style for any institution.
